# 🐍 Snake Game

A classic Snake game built with Python and Pygame.

---

## 🎮 Gameplay

Use arrow keys to control the snake. Eat the red apples to grow and earn points. Avoid hitting the walls or yourself!

| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| ⬆️ Arrow Up | Move up |
| ⬇️ Arrow Down | Move down |
| ⬅️ Arrow Left | Move left |
| ➡️ Arrow Right | Move right |
| **R** | Restart after Game Over |

---

