![Snake Game](screenshot.png)

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Python 3.13**
- **Pygame**

---

## 🚀 How to Run

### 1. Clone the repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/snake_game
cd snake_game
```

### 2. Install dependencies
```bash
pip install pygame
```

### 3. Run the game
```bash
python snake.py
```

---

## ✨ Features

- 🐍 Animated snake with eyes
- 🍎 Randomly spawning food
- 📊 Score counter
- 💀 Game Over screen
- 🔄 Restart with R key
- 🎨 Dark theme with smooth graphics

